<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Nestle.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Nestle.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corporation has issued 7.5 million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Nestle SA, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 50 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,800 CHF		 PREMIUM	9.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.63 CHF		  GEARING	13.41 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   30.SEP.98		 PAYDATE	02.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 50</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1,764 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
